WEBVTT

00:00:59.370 --> 00:01:02.720
And to save us some time,
I'm going to explain what's going on here.

00:01:02.744 --> 00:01:07.149
Each of the piles of LEGOs
is a deconstructed work of art

00:01:07.173 --> 00:01:09.022
in the style of a famous artist.

00:01:09.046 --> 00:01:12.200
So, does anybody recognize
the artist on the left?

00:01:12.641 --> 00:01:14.174
They used a lot of red.

00:01:14.865 --> 00:01:16.265
I heard "Rothko," yeah.

00:01:16.873 --> 00:01:18.024
The second one?

00:01:18.048 --> 00:01:19.199
(Audience) Mondrian.

00:01:19.223 --> 00:01:20.785
Alex Rosenthal: Yeah, well done.

00:01:20.809 --> 00:01:23.658
And the third one?
This is the hardest one --

00:01:25.404 --> 00:01:26.632
Yeah, Klimt, I heard it.

00:01:26.950 --> 00:01:30.171
Well done, the color
is the biggest clue there.